(238378, 14685, 318, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it. I was going to give it average thinking that it should have been in B&amp;W. But the red Coke sign, the red (whatchamacallit over the shop) the door, and even the red fork on the bike, make it above ordinary. :)  7</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it. I was going to give it average thinking that it should have been in B&W. But the red Coke sign, the red (whatchamacallit over the shop) the door, and even the red fork on the bike, make it above ordinary. :)  7', '2003-03-17 01:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(238382, 14904, 3735, '<td valign="top">so cool !!   Looks like fun 7</td>', 'so cool !!   Looks like fun 7', '2003-03-17 02:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(238385, 14748, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus, colors and lighting.  No central focal point, it''s kinda lacking in a main central point.</td>', 'Very nice focus, colors and lighting.  No central focal point, it''s kinda lacking in a main central point.', '2003-03-17 02:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
