(238389, 14693, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Good colors and focus.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Good colors and focus.', '2003-03-17 02:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(238390, 14862, 6132, '<td valign="top">*lol*...one of few photos that actually made me break a smile  (quite an achievement if you ask me.) Nice idea, the only improvements I would personally make is to remove some of the slight distractions in the background, especially in the upper left corner.</td>', '*lol*...one of few photos that actually made me break a smile  (quite an achievement if you ask me.) Nice idea, the only improvements I would personally make is to remove some of the slight distractions in the background, especially in the upper left corner.', '2003-03-17 02:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(238391, 14837, 6172, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like a snapshot.  Not very good lighting, the face is overexposed and the rest is in a dark shadow.</td>', 'Looks too much like a snapshot.  Not very good lighting, the face is overexposed and the rest is in a dark shadow.', '2003-03-17 02:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(238392, 14942, 6132, '<td valign="top">A great photo. I love it how all of the floors have been represented and well balanced in the image.</td>', 'A great photo. I love it how all of the floors have been represented and well balanced in the image.', '2003-03-17 02:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(238393, 14434, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice "artsy" concept.  I like the colors (if you can call it that).  The darkness and dinginess of the top (outside) of the photo seem to push ones eyes to the center and bottom.  There is a human form down there isn''t there?  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice "artsy" concept.  I like the colors (if you can call it that).  The darkness and dinginess of the top (outside) of the photo seem to push ones eyes to the center and bottom.  There is a human form down there isn''t there?  Good luck!', '2003-03-17 02:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(238394, 14857, 6172, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot except for that one piece of ice in the front center of the shot.  You could have gotten around that in some way I am sure.</td>', 'I really like this shot except for that one piece of ice in the front center of the shot.  You could have gotten around that in some way I am sure.', '2003-03-17 02:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(238396, 14699, 318, '<td valign="top">I just have to give you an extra point for minimalism. :)</td>', 'I just have to give you an extra point for minimalism. :)', '2003-03-17 02:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(238398, 14344, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice job of framing.  I will overlook the fact that you aren''t really providing a view "from above".  Nice colors on the power station, seems like they could have been in better focus.</td>', 'Very nice job of framing.  I will overlook the fact that you aren''t really providing a view "from above".  Nice colors on the power station, seems like they could have been in better focus.', '2003-03-17 02:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(238399, 14772, 318, '<td valign="top">A schoolbook example of a pattern. [8]</td>', 'A schoolbook example of a pattern. [8]', '2003-03-17 02:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(238400, 14759, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept here.  I like the darkness, but it seems like you could have created  better definition in the photo somehow, it just seems to all run together a little bit too much.</td>', 'Very nice concept here.  I like the darkness, but it seems like you could have created  better definition in the photo somehow, it just seems to all run together a little bit too much.', '2003-03-17 02:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(238401, 14782, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  A nice photo.  Great focus, but it seems like the whole photo would have been improved by a different colored background, the background you employed is the same as one of the colors of the snake, which lessens the contrast.</td>', 'Very cute!  A nice photo.  Great focus, but it seems like the whole photo would have been improved by a different colored background, the background you employed is the same as one of the colors of the snake, which lessens the contrast.', '2003-03-17 02:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(238402, 14790, 6172, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, and would have given a high mark, but for one thing.  The stairs are well lit on the top, but there is insufficient lighting farther down.</td>', 'I like this shot, and would have given a high mark, but for one thing.  The stairs are well lit on the top, but there is insufficient lighting farther down.', '2003-03-17 02:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(238404, 14416, 6892, '<td valign="top">I know this waterway to the Sacramento River well. Lovely shot.</td>', 'I know this waterway to the Sacramento River well. Lovely shot.', '2003-03-17 02:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(238406, 14886, 6172, '<td valign="top">Oh come on! You think you are getting good votes just because you have a photo of a hot young lady (you probably will).  Also, I don''t see how your photo provides a view from above (unless your implying that she is).</td>', 'Oh come on! You think you are getting good votes just because you have a photo of a hot young lady (you probably will).  Also, I don''t see how your photo provides a view from above (unless your implying that she is).', '2003-03-17 02:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(238408, 14850, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo,  I like it a lot.  Great focus and color, and I love the flag in the background.  Just one complaint, the lighting on the nose, left eye, and that area of her face isn''t quite right.  There is a little glare and it''s a little too bright.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice photo,  I like it a lot.  Great focus and color, and I love the flag in the background.  Just one complaint, the lighting on the nose, left eye, and that area of her face isn''t quite right.  There is a little glare and it''s a little too bright.  Good luck!', '2003-03-17 02:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(238409, 14945, 6405, '<td valign="top">photograph any subject from a vantage point above it,NOT BELLOW!</td>', 'photograph any subject from a vantage point above it,NOT BELLOW!', '2003-03-17 02:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(238410, 14718, 6172, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is, or is supposed to be.</td>', 'I have no idea what this is, or is supposed to be.', '2003-03-17 02:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(238411, 14133, 6405, '<td valign="top">photograph any subject from a vantage point above itNOT BELLOW!</td>', 'photograph any subject from a vantage point above itNOT BELLOW!', '2003-03-17 02:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(238412, 14635, 6405, '<td valign="top">photograph any subject from a vantage point above itNOT BELLOW!</td>', 'photograph any subject from a vantage point above itNOT BELLOW!', '2003-03-17 02:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(238414, 14763, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  I don''t think the empty space at the top helped any.</td>', 'Very nice colors.  I don''t think the empty space at the top helped any.', '2003-03-17 02:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(238451, 14886, 7067, '<td valign="top">I like how the background of this photo offsets the subject.  Some changes I can think of:  1) don''t cut off the tips of her toes, 2) remove the watch which is quite bright and distracting and interrupts the line of flow of her arm, and 3) reposition the right hand, perhaps on the left knee, as I don''t like where it is right now.  Also, the foreground seems a little too dark and the background a little too saturated.  I would have scored this higher if the vantage point was higher and not so much at eye level.</td>', 'I like how the background of this photo offsets the subject.  Some changes I can think of:  1) don''t cut off the tips of her toes, 2) remove the watch which is quite bright and distracting and interrupts the line of flow of her arm, and 3) reposition the right hand, perhaps on the left knee, as I don''t like where it is right now.  Also, the foreground seems a little too dark and the background a little too saturated.  I would have scored this higher if the vantage point was higher and not so much at eye level.', '2003-03-17 03:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(238456, 14510, 7067, '<td valign="top">Focus could be a little sharper but good work on capturing the ice crystals.  Nice use of diffuse light.</td>', 'Focus could be a little sharper but good work on capturing the ice crystals.  Nice use of diffuse light.', '2003-03-17 03:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(238459, 14006, 7067, '<td valign="top">that''s some shiny shoes you have there :-)  Great effect!</td>', 'that''s some shiny shoes you have there :-)  Great effect!', '2003-03-17 03:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(238463, 14775, 7067, '<td valign="top">The first thing that strikes me about this photo is how young and smooth the skin of these hands appear.... so unlike my own.... Great idea.</td>', 'The first thing that strikes me about this photo is how young and smooth the skin of these hands appear.... so unlike my own.... Great idea.', '2003-03-17 03:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(238468, 14763, 7067, '<td valign="top">I quite like the colour contrast and reflection on the teapot.  I do wish the oranges were a little sharper though.</td>', 'I quite like the colour contrast and reflection on the teapot.  I do wish the oranges were a little sharper though.', '2003-03-17 03:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(238470, 14212, 7067, '<td valign="top">You continue to amaze me with the things you can do with this artist wood model!  :-D</td>', 'You continue to amaze me with the things you can do with this artist wood model!  :-D', '2003-03-17 03:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(238473, 14848, 7067, '<td valign="top">Good candid.  Too bad the focus is on the hair and not the child''s eyes.</td>', 'Good candid.  Too bad the focus is on the hair and not the child''s eyes.', '2003-03-17 03:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(238474, 14907, 6892, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro shot. Is the caterpillar coming or going?</td>', 'Wonderful macro shot. Is the caterpillar coming or going?', '2003-03-17 03:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(238476, 14434, 7067, '<td valign="top">This stairwell makes a great photographic subject.  It''s hard to clearly see the person who appears to be lying on the floor at the bottom?</td>', 'This stairwell makes a great photographic subject.  It''s hard to clearly see the person who appears to be lying on the floor at the bottom?', '2003-03-17 03:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(238478, 14884, 7067, '<td valign="top">Great use of light and shadow!</td>', 'Great use of light and shadow!', '2003-03-17 03:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(238480, 14385, 7067, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I''m not a personal fan of large borders.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I''m not a personal fan of large borders.', '2003-03-17 03:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(238483, 14794, 7067, '<td valign="top">Her skin glows with such warmth. :)  Nice use of colours (red shirt, white foreground, olive background).  I would do away with the distracting watch and what appears to be an earring on the right ear.</td>', 'Her skin glows with such warmth. :)  Nice use of colours (red shirt, white foreground, olive background).  I would do away with the distracting watch and what appears to be an earring on the right ear.', '2003-03-17 03:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(238484, 14597, 3037, '<td valign="top">focus focus focus</td>', 'focus focus focus', '2003-03-17 03:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(238486, 14883, 7067, '<td valign="top">The colours are nice here, but the flower isn''t in sharp focus.  The image was sharpened, leaving the edges of the petals looking pixellated, which lowers the quality of this photo.</td>', 'The colours are nice here, but the flower isn''t in sharp focus.  The image was sharpened, leaving the edges of the petals looking pixellated, which lowers the quality of this photo.', '2003-03-17 03:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(238487, 14516, 7067, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little harsh.  Nice picture except for the distracting person wear jeans in front of your tattooed model here.</td>', 'Lighting is a little harsh.  Nice picture except for the distracting person wear jeans in front of your tattooed model here.', '2003-03-17 03:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(238488, 14690, 7067, '<td valign="top">Moving closer to the edge and tilting the camear down more might better convey the danger and height you are at.  Also, the title seems a bit too much.  I would have left out the suicide stuff for it''s rather disheartening.</td>', 'Moving closer to the edge and tilting the camear down more might better convey the danger and height you are at.  Also, the title seems a bit too much.  I would have left out the suicide stuff for it''s rather disheartening.', '2003-03-17 04:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(238489, 14761, 7067, '<td valign="top">Greater depth of focus so that the paint containers are also sharp would improve the photo.</td>', 'Greater depth of focus so that the paint containers are also sharp would improve the photo.', '2003-03-17 04:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(238490, 14838, 3900, '<td valign="top">Hah, too cute.  Great focus on the face.</td>', 'Hah, too cute.  Great focus on the face.', '2003-03-17 04:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(238491, 14812, 7067, '<td valign="top">Um, isn''t the theme ''FROM ABOVE''?</td>', 'Um, isn''t the theme ''FROM ABOVE''?', '2003-03-17 04:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(238492, 14782, 3900, '<td valign="top">Wow, great shot...perfectly framed and focussed.</td>', 'Wow, great shot...perfectly framed and focussed.', '2003-03-17 04:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(238493, 14814, 7232, '<td valign="top">Harder umbrages, better centering</td>', 'Harder umbrages, better centering', '2003-03-17 04:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(238494, 14931, 3900, '<td valign="top">Great challenge interpretation, colors, and clarity.</td>', 'Great challenge interpretation, colors, and clarity.', '2003-03-17 04:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(238498, 14384, 5865, '<td valign="top">I love the idea behind this photograph and I like the way the shadow of the glass is used to fill the frame.  The colour of the drink itself  adds to the shot I think.  Great photograph.</td>', 'I love the idea behind this photograph and I like the way the shadow of the glass is used to fill the frame.  The colour of the drink itself  adds to the shot I think.  Great photograph.', '2003-03-17 04:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(238499, 14876, 5865, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this photograph.  The composition is wonderful in my opinion and I like the colour of the metal.</td>', 'I really enjoyed this photograph.  The composition is wonderful in my opinion and I like the colour of the metal.', '2003-03-17 04:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(238500, 14708, 5865, '<td valign="top">I think this is a beautiful shot.  The lighting is superb.</td>', 'I think this is a beautiful shot.  The lighting is superb.', '2003-03-17 04:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(238505, 14635, 1143, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I just don''t think you shot this from a point ABOVE the subject so it''s gonna hurt your overall score.  :(</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I just don''t think you shot this from a point ABOVE the subject so it''s gonna hurt your overall score.  :(', '2003-03-17 05:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(238525, 14871, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''d be intrigues to know how you''ve got this quality into this shot - it almost looks painted! great work - for me, perhaps a little more contrast overall would have aded mystery even more. Is it a very dark shot that''s been lightened hugely?</td>', 'I''d be intrigues to know how you''ve got this quality into this shot - it almost looks painted! great work - for me, perhaps a little more contrast overall would have aded mystery even more. Is it a very dark shot that''s been lightened hugely?', '2003-03-17 07:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(238526, 14592, 6999, '<td valign="top">For me, not enough real interest - there''s no apparent subject, which is not necessarily a fault, but without texture, light or some real ''odd'' element it doesn''t quite engage enough. As ever, just my opinion.</td>', 'For me, not enough real interest - there''s no apparent subject, which is not necessarily a fault, but without texture, light or some real ''odd'' element it doesn''t quite engage enough. As ever, just my opinion.', '2003-03-17 07:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(238527, 14938, 3746, '<td valign="top">I love the warm flowing lines of this shot :-)</td>', 'I love the warm flowing lines of this shot :-)', '2003-03-17 07:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(238528, 14133, 6999, '<td valign="top">I see your point, but the challenge specifically states ''taken from above it''. Otherwise - nice shot, though perhaps getting the whole crane in shot would have added a feeling of completeness - can''t personally see a benenfit to the lack of it.</td>', 'I see your point, but the challenge specifically states ''taken from above it''. Otherwise - nice shot, though perhaps getting the whole crane in shot would have added a feeling of completeness - can''t personally see a benenfit to the lack of it.', '2003-03-17 07:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(238529, 14290, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, pretty well, er, ''executed''. Not sure about the eyes on the camera - though it helps the ''joke'' element of course. And the sword is suitably ridiculous - this is growing on me with every minute. I hope everyone else pays enough attention to get all the details.</td>', 'Nice idea, pretty well, er, ''executed''. Not sure about the eyes on the camera - though it helps the ''joke'' element of course. And the sword is suitably ridiculous - this is growing on me with every minute. I hope everyone else pays enough attention to get all the details.', '2003-03-17 07:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(238530, 14844, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the close crop of the top of the boots - emphasises the ''from above'' element nicely, and a great old trick it is too. I''m not a fan of such ''studio'' photography though, but it''s well done.</td>', 'Like the close crop of the top of the boots - emphasises the ''from above'' element nicely, and a great old trick it is too. I''m not a fan of such ''studio'' photography though, but it''s well done.', '2003-03-17 07:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(238531, 14871, 7010, '<td valign="top">Waaa! Such a nice image, but such a pity the quality had to suffer (from sharpening?). Still: 7</td>', 'Waaa! Such a nice image, but such a pity the quality had to suffer (from sharpening?). Still: 7', '2003-03-17 07:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(238532, 14741, 7010, '<td valign="top">I think you probably would have achieved more impact with slower shutterspeeds (to get the hazy effect) and without the frame ;-)</td>', 'I think you probably would have achieved more impact with slower shutterspeeds (to get the hazy effect) and without the frame ;-)', '2003-03-17 07:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(238533, 14094, 7010, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t like pet-snapshots, but this one is great! (Too bad of the cropped tail, though. But I see that including the tail should have degraded the composition)</td>', 'I normally don''t like pet-snapshots, but this one is great! (Too bad of the cropped tail, though. But I see that including the tail should have degraded the composition)', '2003-03-17 07:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(238534, 14824, 6999, '<td valign="top">For me, such a simple (good simple) shot requires that you capture the symmetry of the boat - else there''s a funny impression of distortion. The whites have flared out too - which helps the ''cleanliness'' of the image, but detracts from the interest. If you''d nailed the symmetry, then the coiled rope would become a much stronger element of the shot too - paralleling and off-setting the cirular thing in the cabin roof. Very close to being a great shot.</td>', 'For me, such a simple (good simple) shot requires that you capture the symmetry of the boat - else there''s a funny impression of distortion. The whites have flared out too - which helps the ''cleanliness'' of the image, but detracts from the interest. If you''d nailed the symmetry, then the coiled rope would become a much stronger element of the shot too - paralleling and off-setting the cirular thing in the cabin roof. Very close to being a great shot.', '2003-03-17 07:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(238536, 14886, 7010, '<td valign="top">Image quality=10 !  Meeting challenge= 4   Final score: 7</td>', 'Image quality=10 !  Meeting challenge= 4   Final score: 7', '2003-03-17 07:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(238537, 14793, 6999, '<td valign="top">love the way the road winds through the frame - and one of few b&amp;w images that seems to benefit from being so.</td>', 'love the way the road winds through the frame - and one of few b&w images that seems to benefit from being so.', '2003-03-17 07:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(238538, 14768, 7010, '<td valign="top">Very special. But I don''t see where it meets the challenge. I find the cropped cat interesting. It looks like you did it on purpose. It gives e strange feel to this image. It''s maybe a little too soft imho. Regards, Marco.</td>', 'Very special. But I don''t see where it meets the challenge. I find the cropped cat interesting. It looks like you did it on purpose. It gives e strange feel to this image. It''s maybe a little too soft imho. Regards, Marco.', '2003-03-17 07:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
