(238542, 14763, 6999, '<td valign="top">like the confidence that allows you to leave the white space - definitely benefits the shot. And technically, keeping the camera so (nearly)  invisible is an achievement. Something doesn''t quite appeal about it though - at the moment not sure what - it may be the lack of depth to the shadows (deliberate I''m sure, but this is my personal prefernce, of course)</td>', 'like the confidence that allows you to leave the white space - definitely benefits the shot. And technically, keeping the camera so (nearly)  invisible is an achievement. Something doesn''t quite appeal about it though - at the moment not sure what - it may be the lack of depth to the shadows (deliberate I''m sure, but this is my personal prefernce, of course)', '2003-03-17 07:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(238543, 14864, 7010, '<td valign="top">I like the soft colours of this image. The inclusion of the bridge enlarges the ''from above''-effect, but I''m not sure about the combination from a esthaetical point of view. 8</td>', 'I like the soft colours of this image. The inclusion of the bridge enlarges the ''from above''-effect, but I''m not sure about the combination from a esthaetical point of view. 8', '2003-03-17 07:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(238544, 14843, 6999, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent of something for me - don''t know what. There''s a certain quality from the early years of photography here too - an interest in form, texture, things that no-one would paint. Liek this very much.</td>', 'Reminiscent of something for me - don''t know what. There''s a certain quality from the early years of photography here too - an interest in form, texture, things that no-one would paint. Liek this very much.', '2003-03-17 07:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(238546, 14588, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oops. If this is a reflection, then I think you need to include something that makes that clear - the challenge, I''m afraid, required ''any subject, taken from above it''</td>', 'Oops. If this is a reflection, then I think you need to include something that makes that clear - the challenge, I''m afraid, required ''any subject, taken from above it''', '2003-03-17 07:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(238549, 14857, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good sky - good boat too, though for me you would have had more impact with a focus on the ice, rather than the reflections to meet the challenge more exactly. Interesting shot though.</td>', 'Good sky - good boat too, though for me you would have had more impact with a focus on the ice, rather than the reflections to meet the challenge more exactly. Interesting shot though.', '2003-03-17 07:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(238551, 14907, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fabulous detail, great colour, great shot in general. For the challenge though, there''s nothing to give an impression of the verticality of this climb - nothing that says this isn''t a horizontal leaf. I''m not suggesting it''s made up, but that the shot needs an element to say ''shooting down''. There wasn''t a requirement to make that point in the challenge, obviously, but it''s an element I feel is necessary in this case. Still a very good photo though</td>', 'Fabulous detail, great colour, great shot in general. For the challenge though, there''s nothing to give an impression of the verticality of this climb - nothing that says this isn''t a horizontal leaf. I''m not suggesting it''s made up, but that the shot needs an element to say ''shooting down''. There wasn''t a requirement to make that point in the challenge, obviously, but it''s an element I feel is necessary in this case. Still a very good photo though', '2003-03-17 07:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(238553, 14919, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, just lacking (for me) a suggestion that it''s taken downwards. Whilst I''m sure it is, there''s nothing to say it isn''t. Not a specific requirement, I know, but for me an implicit requirement.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, just lacking (for me) a suggestion that it''s taken downwards. Whilst I''m sure it is, there''s nothing to say it isn''t. Not a specific requirement, I know, but for me an implicit requirement.', '2003-03-17 08:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
