(238987, 14790, 6100, '<td valign="top">This could have been a "six" in the numbers challenge. Instead, you''ve got a beautifully composed image. I really like the way you''ve positioned the curve of the stairs. You might have considered some additional light further down in the stairwell but lacking that doesn''t detract from this photo.</td>', 'This could have been a "six" in the numbers challenge. Instead, you''ve got a beautifully composed image. I really like the way you''ve positioned the curve of the stairs. You might have considered some additional light further down in the stairwell but lacking that doesn''t detract from this photo.', '2003-03-17 13:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(238991, 14907, 6100, '<td valign="top">Saw the posts about whether this was taken looking down or level or whatever. I had already scored it and didn''t question what direction it was taken in. You had already gotten a 10 from me because it''s an exceptional image with good DOF and good composition. Interesting little critter, too! Has the "WOW" factor that people sometimes talk about.</td>', 'Saw the posts about whether this was taken looking down or level or whatever. I had already scored it and didn''t question what direction it was taken in. You had already gotten a 10 from me because it''s an exceptional image with good DOF and good composition. Interesting little critter, too! Has the "WOW" factor that people sometimes talk about.', '2003-03-17 13:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
