(239278, 14891, 6532, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the few that actually fulfills my interpretation of the challenge - to capture a subjet from above.  Nice contrast.  Imbalanced on right and left sides other wise an excellent pic - 9</td>', 'I think this is one of the few that actually fulfills my interpretation of the challenge - to capture a subjet from above.  Nice contrast.  Imbalanced on right and left sides other wise an excellent pic - 9', '2003-03-17 17:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
