(239308, 14943, 2978, '<td valign="top">About cityscape, I think there has to be either something, like city landmark, as subject of the image, or nothing dominent as texture and pattern. I find neither of them here. Hope my theory is helpful.</td>', 'About cityscape, I think there has to be either something, like city landmark, as subject of the image, or nothing dominent as texture and pattern. I find neither of them here. Hope my theory is helpful.', '2003-03-17 17:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
