(239314, 14678, 2978, '<td valign="top">I like the frame work, then the texture of the stairs, and finally, the boy. His white T-shite works too.</td>', 'I like the frame work, then the texture of the stairs, and finally, the boy. His white T-shite works too.', '2003-03-17 17:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
