(239316, 14015, 327, '<td valign="top">Wheeeeeeeie. I very much love this shot. Super composition, light, color and feeling.....wow. This is sooooooooooooo good. Look at that moody sky. Heathcliff!</td>', 'Wheeeeeeeie. I very much love this shot. Super composition, light, color and feeling.....wow. This is sooooooooooooo good. Look at that moody sky. Heathcliff!', '2003-03-17 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
