(239322, 14759, 2978, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract line and lighting create a rhythm and the border works too. My only little comment is the monochrome, not sure about the colour.</td>', 'Cool abstract line and lighting create a rhythm and the border works too. My only little comment is the monochrome, not sure about the colour.', '2003-03-17 17:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(239328, 14942, 4517, '<td valign="top">If this was my pic i would have used unsharp mask to sharpen it a lot more. It`s a great photo but a little soft for me. 7</td>', 'If this was my pic i would have used unsharp mask to sharpen it a lot more. It`s a great photo but a little soft for me. 7', '2003-03-17 18:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(239329, 14907, 5212, '<td valign="top">Just about perfect.  I would maybe have cropped out that light spot on the leaf, it''s just a little distracting to me.  I love the red behind teh caterpiller, really contrasts well with the little guy.  Good luck. 9</td>', 'Just about perfect.  I would maybe have cropped out that light spot on the leaf, it''s just a little distracting to me.  I love the red behind teh caterpiller, really contrasts well with the little guy.  Good luck. 9', '2003-03-17 18:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
