(239353, 14942, 5266, '<td valign="top">Is this a mall in Sydney, Australia?  Looks like one I visited once.  I like the perspective here - all the different floors you have captured.  But then there''s the mall lighting .. oh well!!</td>', 'Is this a mall in Sydney, Australia?  Looks like one I visited once.  I like the perspective here - all the different floors you have captured.  But then there''s the mall lighting .. oh well!!', '2003-03-17 18:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
