(239377, 14747, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful portrait :)  This is a great shot of a child... The fact that she is looking up at you really enhances the impact of this shot.. = 10 - setzler</td>', 'beautiful portrait :)  This is a great shot of a child... The fact that she is looking up at you really enhances the impact of this shot.. = 10 - setzler', '2003-03-17 18:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
