(239382, 14907, 4536, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, good colors,DOF and composition, but this challenge was,IMO, to shoot something from above and to give the perspective of looking down on something. I know you shot down on him, but it doesn''t look/feel  that way.</td>', 'This is a great shot, good colors,DOF and composition, but this challenge was,IMO, to shoot something from above and to give the perspective of looking down on something. I know you shot down on him, but it doesn''t look/feel  that way.', '2003-03-17 18:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(239383, 14763, 3260, '<td valign="top">Wow. Impressive composition.</td>', 'Wow. Impressive composition.', '2003-03-17 18:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(239384, 14948, 2978, '<td valign="top">Good shot. It''s the view I like to see in this challenge.</td>', 'Good shot. It''s the view I like to see in this challenge.', '2003-03-17 18:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(239385, 14752, 6893, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2003-03-17 18:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(239386, 14945, 3260, '<td valign="top">Very nice! What is this, the giant badminton ''thingy''?</td>', 'Very nice! What is this, the giant badminton ''thingy''?', '2003-03-17 19:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(239387, 14898, 5266, '<td valign="top">I''ll drink to that!!!  Is that a stubby bottle??  I like the sepia look used here.  The scratches on the table make me get a feeling that this is from a long time ago - a beer on my grandfather''s scratched up kitchen table!!  Nice job.  Thanks for the trip down memory lane.</td>', 'I''ll drink to that!!!  Is that a stubby bottle??  I like the sepia look used here.  The scratches on the table make me get a feeling that this is from a long time ago - a beer on my grandfather''s scratched up kitchen table!!  Nice job.  Thanks for the trip down memory lane.', '2003-03-17 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(239389, 14816, 2978, '<td valign="top">Just a bit above. I think those trees make too much texture.</td>', 'Just a bit above. I think those trees make too much texture.', '2003-03-17 19:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(239390, 14812, 1005, '<td valign="top">First, it''s the wrong direction, up not down.  Very dark picture.  Next, the focus seems to be close to the bottom.  4 Swash</td>', 'First, it''s the wrong direction, up not down.  Very dark picture.  Next, the focus seems to be close to the bottom.  4 Swash', '2003-03-17 19:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(239393, 14697, 1005, '<td valign="top">First, this is looking up, not down.  Next, the tree bark seems overly red (shouldn''t it be more like white?)  Finally, compression - I think the shot is clear enough, but the jpeg compression seems to have taken away too much detail (that''s what happened to me last week).  4 Swash</td>', 'First, this is looking up, not down.  Next, the tree bark seems overly red (shouldn''t it be more like white?)  Finally, compression - I think the shot is clear enough, but the jpeg compression seems to have taken away too much detail (that''s what happened to me last week).  4 Swash', '2003-03-17 19:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(239394, 14938, 1005, '<td valign="top">Har Har.....it''s an O.K. shot, but NOT one I want to see.  The porcelain seems grainy, if you can select a lower ISO, it might help.  4 Swash</td>', 'Har Har.....it''s an O.K. shot, but NOT one I want to see.  The porcelain seems grainy, if you can select a lower ISO, it might help.  4 Swash', '2003-03-17 19:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(239395, 14451, 1005, '<td valign="top">Seems much more like looking out (straight) than looking down.  Not a very interesting photo to look at.  Focus - it''s probably compression issues, but it doesn''t look very sharp.  4 Swash</td>', 'Seems much more like looking out (straight) than looking down.  Not a very interesting photo to look at.  Focus - it''s probably compression issues, but it doesn''t look very sharp.  4 Swash', '2003-03-17 19:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(239396, 14698, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting photo and a neat effect, but unless I''m grossly mistaken, you are looking up, not down.  Sharpness - could be overly sharpened or compression issues or post-manip issues, but the clarity isn''t very sharp.  5 Swash <br/>OPA.......</td>', 'It''s an interesting photo and a neat effect, but unless I''m grossly mistaken, you are looking up, not down.  Sharpness - could be overly sharpened or compression issues or post-manip issues, but the clarity isn''t very sharp.  5 Swash OPA.......', '2003-03-17 19:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(239398, 14823, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting view, but very hard to say looking up/down/sideways....  I''m not certain how you got this effect, but personally, I don''t really care for it much.  5 Swash</td>', 'Interesting view, but very hard to say looking up/down/sideways....  I''m not certain how you got this effect, but personally, I don''t really care for it much.  5 Swash', '2003-03-17 19:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(239399, 14133, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear photo!  Challenge not met, sorry, but you are either looking sideways or up - the challenge was to look down.  5 Swash</td>', 'Very clear photo!  Challenge not met, sorry, but you are either looking sideways or up - the challenge was to look down.  5 Swash', '2003-03-17 19:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(239400, 14449, 1005, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Color and focus seem pretty good, but grain and jpeg compression take away much of the quality of this photo.  5 Swash</td>', 'Challenge met.  Color and focus seem pretty good, but grain and jpeg compression take away much of the quality of this photo.  5 Swash', '2003-03-17 19:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(239402, 14862, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nasty!  I guess it was a good thing you were wearing a hat!  Focus - hard to say, nothing seems totally sharp.  Lighting - also a little questionable, the bird guano is a bit blown and the hat hard to distinguish (no suggestions, white on black is hard to do well).  5 Swash</td>', 'Nasty!  I guess it was a good thing you were wearing a hat!  Focus - hard to say, nothing seems totally sharp.  Lighting - also a little questionable, the bird guano is a bit blown and the hat hard to distinguish (no suggestions, white on black is hard to do well).  5 Swash', '2003-03-17 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(239405, 14685, 2978, '<td valign="top">Great snap shot, esp, the red tonality. Good job</td>', 'Great snap shot, esp, the red tonality. Good job', '2003-03-17 19:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(239406, 14588, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sharp photo!  Good color.  Challenge - fully missed the idea, you are looking up, not down.  I see a mosaic of checkerboard mainly on the sky, I don''t know what caused it, but it really hurts this image.  5 Swash</td>', 'Sharp photo!  Good color.  Challenge - fully missed the idea, you are looking up, not down.  I see a mosaic of checkerboard mainly on the sky, I don''t know what caused it, but it really hurts this image.  5 Swash', '2003-03-17 19:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
