(239807, 14824, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image and focusing.<br/>colour is nice and bright.  <br/>Lighting is all natural. <br/> I like the rope the way it''s all coiled up like that.  I just wish you had shown the whole boat and had not cut it off the way you did.</td>', 'Nice sharp image and focusing.colour is nice and bright.  Lighting is all natural.  I like the rope the way it''s all coiled up like that.  I just wish you had shown the whole boat and had not cut it off the way you did.', '2003-03-18 01:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(239808, 14780, 6892, '<td valign="top">Closer my God to Thee...</td>', 'Closer my God to Thee...', '2003-03-18 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(239809, 14693, 6892, '<td valign="top">You clearly kept in mind the theme of this contest "from above." The bright red of the structure contrasts nicely against the tanbark.</td>', 'You clearly kept in mind the theme of this contest "from above." The bright red of the structure contrasts nicely against the tanbark.', '2003-03-18 01:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(239813, 14902, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well composed photo, I really like this one, even the thumbnail awakened my interest immediately. Good job.</td>', 'Well composed photo, I really like this one, even the thumbnail awakened my interest immediately. Good job.', '2003-03-18 02:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(239819, 14434, 6349, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this challenge.  Is that a person lying on the ground?  Its very optical illusionish and the tone of it is great.  Great job.</td>', 'One of my favorites this challenge.  Is that a person lying on the ground?  Its very optical illusionish and the tone of it is great.  Great job.', '2003-03-18 03:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(239820, 14870, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  One of my favorites.  Finally a kid shot where the kid is actually cute and posed with what I consider are normal looking people like myself.  I like the face that the other folks are only seen from the waist down.  Great composition and use of black and white since the kid has a light colored jacket on and everyone else is dark.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  One of my favorites.  Finally a kid shot where the kid is actually cute and posed with what I consider are normal looking people like myself.  I like the face that the other folks are only seen from the waist down.  Great composition and use of black and white since the kid has a light colored jacket on and everyone else is dark.', '2003-03-18 03:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(239821, 14907, 6349, '<td valign="top">wow.  awesome shot.  i think i read about this in the forums.  it''s a shame people think this is not "from above," they must not know how to read (the title).  I think it''s definetely one of the best this challenge.  Great focus and clarity and the complimentary red and green make an interesting place to have the yellow black and white catepillar in between.  Awesome shot.</td>', 'wow.  awesome shot.  i think i read about this in the forums.  it''s a shame people think this is not "from above," they must not know how to read (the title).  I think it''s definetely one of the best this challenge.  Great focus and clarity and the complimentary red and green make an interesting place to have the yellow black and white catepillar in between.  Awesome shot.', '2003-03-18 03:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(239822, 14823, 6349, '<td valign="top">ok.  this is awesome.  how did you get the high key effect of the white border?  i''d love to know.  I guess its just naturally exposed with the sunlight.  The purplish tint at the top of the end of the slide bothers me slightly and I would have dropped the saturation on magenta to get rid of it.  Also, it would be good to go back and get rid of the scratch on the left after the contest (when you''re allowed), it''s a shame we can''t spot edit.  Still, as it is, it is one of my favorites this week.  great job.</td>', 'ok.  this is awesome.  how did you get the high key effect of the white border?  i''d love to know.  I guess its just naturally exposed with the sunlight.  The purplish tint at the top of the end of the slide bothers me slightly and I would have dropped the saturation on magenta to get rid of it.  Also, it would be good to go back and get rid of the scratch on the left after the contest (when you''re allowed), it''s a shame we can''t spot edit.  Still, as it is, it is one of my favorites this week.  great job.', '2003-03-18 03:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(239824, 14678, 6349, '<td valign="top">Pretty great shot!  I really like the composition.  Very modern.  Interesting lighting.  One of my favorites.  I wold have liked the person in a bit more focus though.  Or perhaps they are just too small and I''d like to see this picture in its original size.  Great job.</td>', 'Pretty great shot!  I really like the composition.  Very modern.  Interesting lighting.  One of my favorites.  I wold have liked the person in a bit more focus though.  Or perhaps they are just too small and I''d like to see this picture in its original size.  Great job.', '2003-03-18 03:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(239825, 14846, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is really really superb.  I love everything about this shot.  It is a great idea.  I''d love to see this with a wide angle lens.  Awesome job.  Definitely one of my top choices this week.</td>', 'This is really really superb.  I love everything about this shot.  It is a great idea.  I''d love to see this with a wide angle lens.  Awesome job.  Definitely one of my top choices this week.', '2003-03-18 03:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(239826, 14942, 6349, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot.  you could use this for this weeks challenge too!  Some of the people look slightly blurry and I''d like them totally still and in focus or either really blurry with motion.  Also, I don''t really like the colors of it that much, but that''s not your fault, it''s the building.  Still, I might have played with the colors a little bit to make ti more dramatic or made it black and white.  A great shot.  Rock on!</td>', 'this is a great shot.  you could use this for this weeks challenge too!  Some of the people look slightly blurry and I''d like them totally still and in focus or either really blurry with motion.  Also, I don''t really like the colors of it that much, but that''s not your fault, it''s the building.  Still, I might have played with the colors a little bit to make ti more dramatic or made it black and white.  A great shot.  Rock on!', '2003-03-18 03:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(239827, 14872, 6349, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot.  Great focus.  The best close of seagull shot I think I''ve ever seen.  Love the red eye.  Great job.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Really nice shot.  Great focus.  The best close of seagull shot I think I''ve ever seen.  Love the red eye.  Great job.  Keep up the good work.', '2003-03-18 03:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(239828, 14386, 6349, '<td valign="top">this is very professional looking but uninteresting to my taste, although I cannot ignore the technical merit of such a crisp clean shot with excellent lighting.  One of the best this week but not something I would want to hang on my wall and cherish as art.</td>', 'this is very professional looking but uninteresting to my taste, although I cannot ignore the technical merit of such a crisp clean shot with excellent lighting.  One of the best this week but not something I would want to hang on my wall and cherish as art.', '2003-03-18 03:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(239829, 14850, 6349, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot.  Love the pose, the hair and look in eyes especially.  The crop, doesn''t get any better than that, unless of course, you went down, but that may not have been appropriate.  The fag is great.  The lighting could be a little better.  Overall, a great shot, one of the best this week.</td>', 'Really nice shot.  Love the pose, the hair and look in eyes especially.  The crop, doesn''t get any better than that, unless of course, you went down, but that may not have been appropriate.  The fag is great.  The lighting could be a little better.  Overall, a great shot, one of the best this week.', '2003-03-18 03:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(239831, 14772, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really like this for some reason i can''t put my finger on exactly why.  At first it seemed ugly and strange but the more i looked at it the more it intrigued me.  For some reason it reminds me of MC Escher and i feel like it should be blown up to poster size.  Great photograph and very artistic in a non flamboyant way.</td>', 'I really like this for some reason i can''t put my finger on exactly why.  At first it seemed ugly and strange but the more i looked at it the more it intrigued me.  For some reason it reminds me of MC Escher and i feel like it should be blown up to poster size.  Great photograph and very artistic in a non flamboyant way.', '2003-03-18 03:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(239833, 14814, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Nice subject, colors, composition.  Good light and texture.  what can i say, a very good photo.</td>', 'Very interesting.  Nice subject, colors, composition.  Good light and texture.  what can i say, a very good photo.', '2003-03-18 03:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(239834, 14605, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot but i have to say "SHAME ON YOU" for not getting a picture from this angle of them doing a trick!  (or at least riding)  This picture is very good but that would have been AWESOME.  Keep following the skateboarders though, they make excellent subjects.</td>', 'I really like this shot but i have to say "SHAME ON YOU" for not getting a picture from this angle of them doing a trick!  (or at least riding)  This picture is very good but that would have been AWESOME.  Keep following the skateboarders though, they make excellent subjects.', '2003-03-18 03:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(239835, 14759, 6349, '<td valign="top">Ok.  this is awesome.  Im not quite sure what I''m looking at, but i think it is a heavily edited shot of refelction in water.  this is great art to me and I would love to have a large version.  My favorite this week.  I hope you do well but I fear for the worst (some people on here dont like art very much)</td>', 'Ok.  this is awesome.  Im not quite sure what I''m looking at, but i think it is a heavily edited shot of refelction in water.  this is great art to me and I would love to have a large version.  My favorite this week.  I hope you do well but I fear for the worst (some people on here dont like art very much)', '2003-03-18 03:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(239836, 14702, 6349, '<td valign="top">it''s wierd, when i was thinking of what would be a good shot for this challenge i pictures almost exactly this.  WHere did you actually find what i dreamed of?  I must know!  I think the picture is awesome but I would have liked it from a slightly different angle to get rid of the thing at the top left.  It just doesn''t seem that well balanced.  I would have stayed there all day and shot photos.  I''d love to see all your outakes when the challenge is over.  great job.</td>', 'it''s wierd, when i was thinking of what would be a good shot for this challenge i pictures almost exactly this.  WHere did you actually find what i dreamed of?  I must know!  I think the picture is awesome but I would have liked it from a slightly different angle to get rid of the thing at the top left.  It just doesn''t seem that well balanced.  I would have stayed there all day and shot photos.  I''d love to see all your outakes when the challenge is over.  great job.', '2003-03-18 03:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(239837, 14493, 6349, '<td valign="top">i really like this a lot.  i hope you do well.  there is something mysterious about it even knowing that it is just a "little lamp by your bed".  nice work.</td>', 'i really like this a lot.  i hope you do well.  there is something mysterious about it even knowing that it is just a "little lamp by your bed".  nice work.', '2003-03-18 03:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(239838, 14826, 6349, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot.  two thumbs up for nature.  Th foreground is a bit hard to focus on.  Nice sky.</td>', 'Really nice shot.  two thumbs up for nature.  Th foreground is a bit hard to focus on.  Nice sky.', '2003-03-18 03:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(239839, 14747, 6349, '<td valign="top">Really really great photo.  I was considering something similar when I took my playground shot but I was a bit wary of taking pictures of other people''s kids in this day and age.  (it was bad enough i was creeping around the playground with my camera...gasp).  This is an extremly lovely shot and I hope this girl is someone you know and care about so that you can keep this memory forever.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Really really great photo.  I was considering something similar when I took my playground shot but I was a bit wary of taking pictures of other people''s kids in this day and age.  (it was bad enough i was creeping around the playground with my camera...gasp).  This is an extremly lovely shot and I hope this girl is someone you know and care about so that you can keep this memory forever.  One of my favorites.', '2003-03-18 03:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(239841, 14840, 6349, '<td valign="top">what exactly...um....are the stains....from?    did you just, oh, well, i see, interesting, but that might not be so appropriate for this site.  I think the image is great and artistic and i might not have even noticed, the, um, stains.....if you hadn''t titled it that way.  i think its going to hurt.    but it seems well worth it!</td>', 'what exactly...um....are the stains....from?    did you just, oh, well, i see, interesting, but that might not be so appropriate for this site.  I think the image is great and artistic and i might not have even noticed, the, um, stains.....if you hadn''t titled it that way.  i think its going to hurt.    but it seems well worth it!', '2003-03-18 03:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
