(239893, 14420, 3087, '<td valign="top">I appreciate that you and the subject have a vantage point above the view below you but in terms of this image, it seems that the photographer is little higher than the subject. For that reason I am taking of a couple of points because (in my own opinion) this doesn''t fit the challenge as well as many other images.<br/>It is a lovely image, with interesting light and good composition, though a little small for my preferences.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I appreciate that you and the subject have a vantage point above the view below you but in terms of this image, it seems that the photographer is little higher than the subject. For that reason I am taking of a couple of points because (in my own opinion) this doesn''t fit the challenge as well as many other images.It is a lovely image, with interesting light and good composition, though a little small for my preferences.5, Kavey', '2003-03-18 06:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(239894, 14643, 2978, '<td valign="top">The black ground doesn''t work at all for mosst of the product shot, even worse when the subject is in the dark tone like this</td>', 'The black ground doesn''t work at all for mosst of the product shot, even worse when the subject is in the dark tone like this', '2003-03-18 06:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
