(239897, 14891, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract feel and atmospheric lighting.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'An interesting abstract feel and atmospheric lighting.6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 06:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(239898, 14814, 2978, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure you were in the high enough position to make this shot wider or not but it would be nicer if you can make it to create such pattern.</td>', 'I''m not sure you were in the high enough position to make this shot wider or not but it would be nicer if you can make it to create such pattern.', '2003-03-18 06:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(239899, 14802, 3087, '<td valign="top">The composition here is the strength of the image, for me. I really like the vantage point and the balance of the seat and the wooden floor. I''d like a little more light towards the back of the chair - the shadow is a little too dark for me, though not so much as to remove the shadow completelty.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'The composition here is the strength of the image, for me. I really like the vantage point and the balance of the seat and the wooden floor. I''d like a little more light towards the back of the chair - the shadow is a little too dark for me, though not so much as to remove the shadow completelty.7, Kavey', '2003-03-18 06:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(239900, 14582, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well captured, especially in the eyes. I wasn''t sure about the split background but actually it''s not a problem.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Well captured, especially in the eyes. I wasn''t sure about the split background but actually it''s not a problem.6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 06:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(239901, 14714, 2978, '<td valign="top">Good eyes.</td>', 'Good eyes.', '2003-03-18 06:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(239902, 14846, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflection superimposed on the fish below the surface. Only issue for me is the additional dark shadow at the top right. Without that I''d score this a 7 or 8.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Interesting reflection superimposed on the fish below the surface. Only issue for me is the additional dark shadow at the top right. Without that I''d score this a 7 or 8.6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 06:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(239903, 14006, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting treatment. Composition not very dynamic for me. Perhaps one foot further forward than the other or the feet at an angle to each other?<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Interesting treatment. Composition not very dynamic for me. Perhaps one foot further forward than the other or the feet at an angle to each other?6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 06:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(239904, 14938, 2978, '<td valign="top">Ha ha no comment. Just a question. How many drinks you had to get this shot?</td>', 'Ha ha no comment. Just a question. How many drinks you had to get this shot?', '2003-03-18 06:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(239905, 14312, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured.</td>', 'Nicely captured.', '2003-03-18 06:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(239906, 14793, 2978, '<td valign="top">Excellent curve perspective.</td>', 'Excellent curve perspective.', '2003-03-18 06:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(239907, 14931, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great image capturing both the motionless traffic queues and the moving cross traffic - I do like that blurred truck. A little too much building on the right for my preferences.<br/>6, KAvey</td>', 'Great image capturing both the motionless traffic queues and the moving cross traffic - I do like that blurred truck. A little too much building on the right for my preferences.6, KAvey', '2003-03-18 07:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(239908, 14898, 2978, '<td valign="top">I wouldn ''t know it''s a beer if I hadn''t seen the title. Anyway, I think the focus is more likely on the ground than the bottle.</td>', 'I wouldn ''t know it''s a beer if I hadn''t seen the title. Anyway, I think the focus is more likely on the ground than the bottle.', '2003-03-18 07:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(239910, 14850, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hello Arnit :)<br/>I did some shoots in my evening class studio last night and was inspired by some of the photos you have taken of this model before.<br/>I do like this shot, and it is from above, but it doesn''t say as much to me as the more emotive ones I''ve seen from you before.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Hello Arnit :)I did some shoots in my evening class studio last night and was inspired by some of the photos you have taken of this model before.I do like this shot, and it is from above, but it doesn''t say as much to me as the more emotive ones I''ve seen from you before.6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(239912, 14840, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but needs more lighting behind her for my preference. (Not strong lighting but perhaps just some reflective secondary lighting.<br/>Just my opinion though and perhaps others will like the moody darkness of the shot.<br/>:)<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Nice shot but needs more lighting behind her for my preference. (Not strong lighting but perhaps just some reflective secondary lighting.Just my opinion though and perhaps others will like the moody darkness of the shot.:)6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(239914, 14286, 3087, '<td valign="top">I particularly like this flower shot because of the way some of the background has been included. Whilst it''s still not overly obvious that it''s taken from a vantage point above, it does make it a little clearer as well sa adding a really interesting pattern and use of DOF.<br/>I don''t like the colour balance - seems overly orange throughout the image to me.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'I particularly like this flower shot because of the way some of the background has been included. Whilst it''s still not overly obvious that it''s taken from a vantage point above, it does make it a little clearer as well sa adding a really interesting pattern and use of DOF.I don''t like the colour balance - seems overly orange throughout the image to me.7, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(239915, 14689, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint and shapes. Composition feels unbalanced to me.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint and shapes. Composition feels unbalanced to me.6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(239916, 14905, 3087, '<td valign="top">QuirkY!<br/>I do like the wonderful curve of the pavement and the colour of the bench wood.<br/>I''d prefer the whole image to be a little larger (but same composition).<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'QuirkY!I do like the wonderful curve of the pavement and the colour of the bench wood.I''d prefer the whole image to be a little larger (but same composition).7, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(239918, 14919, 3087, '<td valign="top">It''s not a matter of distrust. I am MORE than happy to take it on trust that this was shot from above. It''s a case of the image itself not reflecting that in it''s content and therefore not SHOWING me the challenge theme within it.<br/>I do like the image though but am marking a little lower for not SHOWING that it meets the challenge. (Which is different from not meeting the challenge in terms of the actual taking).<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'It''s not a matter of distrust. I am MORE than happy to take it on trust that this was shot from above. It''s a case of the image itself not reflecting that in it''s content and therefore not SHOWING me the challenge theme within it.I do like the image though but am marking a little lower for not SHOWING that it meets the challenge. (Which is different from not meeting the challenge in terms of the actual taking).5, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(239921, 14758, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is interesting! I do like the contrast of this soft pretty white Iris and the dried brown leaves beneath!<br/>That said whilst I like the contrast I don''t know that I find those leaves attractive.<br/>Adding points for more evidently meeting the challenge (in terms of SHOWING it) than other flower images submitted, but scoring a little down because I find the dry brown leaves a bit unappealing.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'This is interesting! I do like the contrast of this soft pretty white Iris and the dried brown leaves beneath!That said whilst I like the contrast I don''t know that I find those leaves attractive.Adding points for more evidently meeting the challenge (in terms of SHOWING it) than other flower images submitted, but scoring a little down because I find the dry brown leaves a bit unappealing.6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(239922, 14743, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is growing on me.<br/>Bumping to 7, Kavey</td>', 'This is growing on me.Bumping to 7, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(239923, 14838, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''d like this a LOT more without the red food and water bowl in shot. A completely plain, pale background thrown out of focus by DOF settings (as it is now) would really show the cat off better, IMO.<br/>I think the pose and capture of the cat itself is great.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I''d like this a LOT more without the red food and water bowl in shot. A completely plain, pale background thrown out of focus by DOF settings (as it is now) would really show the cat off better, IMO.I think the pose and capture of the cat itself is great.6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(239924, 14015, 2978, '<td valign="top">Good composition. If this is a candid, even better. If not, the model should be expressing something. That''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Good composition. If this is a candid, even better. If not, the model should be expressing something. That''s just my opinion.', '2003-03-18 07:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
