(239926, 14385, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully taken and the background makes it clear that it was indeed taken from above.<br/>(Not that I doubt that any of the flower images were taken from above, just that many of them don''t make it visually clear within the image itself).<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Beautifully taken and the background makes it clear that it was indeed taken from above.(Not that I doubt that any of the flower images were taken from above, just that many of them don''t make it visually clear within the image itself).7, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
