(239944, 14883, 3087, '<td valign="top">Seems very pixelated and has lots of compression artifacts along edges of petals.<br/>Great vivid colours and like that we''re peeping into the green at the inside edges of the petals.</td>', 'Seems very pixelated and has lots of compression artifacts along edges of petals.Great vivid colours and like that we''re peeping into the green at the inside edges of the petals.', '2003-03-18 07:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(239945, 14417, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this kind of photography enormously - but I don''t think this is so successful: not sure why (it''s only my impression), but perhaps there''s too much distraction here - the ''plants'', the snow, the bits of rubbish. Without that it would approach a sort of abstract quality, rather than being just a pile of rubble. Cool pile of rubble, though.</td>', 'I like this kind of photography enormously - but I don''t think this is so successful: not sure why (it''s only my impression), but perhaps there''s too much distraction here - the ''plants'', the snow, the bits of rubbish. Without that it would approach a sort of abstract quality, rather than being just a pile of rubble. Cool pile of rubble, though.', '2003-03-18 07:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(239946, 14510, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured and love the DOF throwing out the background.<br/>I personally find that although I am happy to believe it''s taken from above, visually it could just as easily be taken from the side - the image itself doesn''t show the challenge has been met, even though I am sure it has.<br/>For me the image has to show it too.<br/>6, Kavey<br/>Would be at least an 8 if I felt it met challenge better.</td>', 'Beautifully captured and love the DOF throwing out the background.I personally find that although I am happy to believe it''s taken from above, visually it could just as easily be taken from the side - the image itself doesn''t show the challenge has been met, even though I am sure it has.For me the image has to show it too.6, KaveyWould be at least an 8 if I felt it met challenge better.', '2003-03-18 07:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(239948, 14710, 3087, '<td valign="top">Feels tilted to the left.<br/>Nice shapes and lighting.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Feels tilted to the left.Nice shapes and lighting.Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(239949, 14817, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way they are walking out of the frame along one of the points of the compass image.<br/>Colour seems a little faded.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'I like the way they are walking out of the frame along one of the points of the compass image.Colour seems a little faded.7, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(239950, 14748, 2978, '<td valign="top">Pity that almost half of the plants are in the dark colour. If so, they and the bright ones would create an interesting pattern in the leaves texture.</td>', 'Pity that almost half of the plants are in the dark colour. If so, they and the bright ones would create an interesting pattern in the leaves texture.', '2003-03-18 07:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(239951, 14832, 3087, '<td valign="top">Could be much more closely cropped for more striking composition.<br/>Definitely crop out that bright thing sticking into the frame from the right. Infact I''d crop in enough to also get rid of that open window in the lower right.<br/>An image with them just a touch further along the walkway with the walkway itself isolated against the black would work best for me.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Could be much more closely cropped for more striking composition.Definitely crop out that bright thing sticking into the frame from the right. Infact I''d crop in enough to also get rid of that open window in the lower right.An image with them just a touch further along the walkway with the walkway itself isolated against the black would work best for me.6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(239952, 14773, 3087, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite resolve what I am looking at but I do like it. It''s an interesting image and I like the dark and light.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I can''t quite resolve what I am looking at but I do like it. It''s an interesting image and I like the dark and light.6, Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(239953, 14894, 3087, '<td valign="top">The rotation doesn''t add anything for me (and I''ve scored previous images with rotated horizons very highly). The shadow from the cliff seems very very blue. Is that because of adjusting the colour balance?<br/>Kavey</td>', 'The rotation doesn''t add anything for me (and I''ve scored previous images with rotated horizons very highly). The shadow from the cliff seems very very blue. Is that because of adjusting the colour balance?Kavey', '2003-03-18 07:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
