(240140, 14650, 6663, '<td valign="top">I like this. I would have ended up doing something like this had I entered this week''s challenge.</td>', 'I like this. I would have ended up doing something like this had I entered this week''s challenge.', '2003-03-18 10:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(240144, 14418, 6663, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to work this out and I''m still not 100% - this is a pool table pocket right? Like the colours. 7.</td>', 'Took me a while to work this out and I''m still not 100% - this is a pool table pocket right? Like the colours. 7.', '2003-03-18 10:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(240146, 14021, 6663, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of perspective - this looks 30feet high! Great level of detail too - right down to specks of dust. A very clever photo. 8.</td>', 'Excellent use of perspective - this looks 30feet high! Great level of detail too - right down to specks of dust. A very clever photo. 8.', '2003-03-18 10:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(240150, 14944, 6663, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle, great use of shutter delay, lovely backdrop. Very good photo. 8.</td>', 'Nice wide angle, great use of shutter delay, lovely backdrop. Very good photo. 8.', '2003-03-18 10:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(240154, 14886, 6663, '<td valign="top">Stunning girl but doesn''t have much to do with ''from above'' in my opinion...</td>', 'Stunning girl but doesn''t have much to do with ''from above'' in my opinion...', '2003-03-18 10:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(240156, 14885, 6663, '<td valign="top">Dog looks a bit disinterested for the photo to have this title...Not a bad shot though.</td>', 'Dog looks a bit disinterested for the photo to have this title...Not a bad shot though.', '2003-03-18 10:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(240158, 14883, 6663, '<td valign="top">Spectacular. Lush vibrant colour, lovely shape and focus. One of my favourites from this challenge. Superb photo. 9.</td>', 'Spectacular. Lush vibrant colour, lovely shape and focus. One of my favourites from this challenge. Superb photo. 9.', '2003-03-18 10:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(240160, 14836, 6663, '<td valign="top">Vertigo strikes! I felt a little giddy looking at this one - great depth, caught the ripples from the water well too. A good shot. 7.</td>', 'Vertigo strikes! I felt a little giddy looking at this one - great depth, caught the ripples from the water well too. A good shot. 7.', '2003-03-18 10:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(240162, 14628, 6663, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Fantastic idea, really well-taken photo, great title too! One of the top efforts this week. 9.</td>', 'Excellent. Fantastic idea, really well-taken photo, great title too! One of the top efforts this week. 9.', '2003-03-18 10:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(240164, 14917, 6663, '<td valign="top">Really good choice of building to shoot at - one of the better cityscape shots from this challenge. 7.</td>', 'Really good choice of building to shoot at - one of the better cityscape shots from this challenge. 7.', '2003-03-18 10:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(240247, 14386, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I like that you kept the image dark.  What kind of light source did you use to get the subtle highlights on the camera? - 10 - Mav</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I like that you kept the image dark.  What kind of light source did you use to get the subtle highlights on the camera? - 10 - Mav', '2003-03-18 12:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(240248, 14826, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice landscape!  At first I thought this might be in West Virginia, but I was there a couple weeks ago and there weren''t that many leaves on the trees.</td>', 'Very nice landscape!  At first I thought this might be in West Virginia, but I was there a couple weeks ago and there weren''t that many leaves on the trees.', '2003-03-18 12:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(240249, 14449, 509, '<td valign="top">This is probably a result of your camera, but there are a lot of jpeg artifacts here, and I think the white balance is off</td>', 'This is probably a result of your camera, but there are a lot of jpeg artifacts here, and I think the white balance is off', '2003-03-18 12:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(240250, 14814, 509, '<td valign="top">I like how the orange chair tops fit with the color of the floor and tables.  I wonder how it would look with the levels adjusted to bring out the orange more.  I like the framing as well, nice job</td>', 'I like how the orange chair tops fit with the color of the floor and tables.  I wonder how it would look with the levels adjusted to bring out the orange more.  I like the framing as well, nice job', '2003-03-18 12:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(240252, 14659, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you were going for this look, but still, I''d like to see a little more detail on the subject''s face.  This could also give the image a little more color.  Either that, or maybe the focus set on the city and the child''s face out of focus.</td>', 'I''m sure you were going for this look, but still, I''d like to see a little more detail on the subject''s face.  This could also give the image a little more color.  Either that, or maybe the focus set on the city and the child''s face out of focus.', '2003-03-18 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(240280, 14849, 6701, '<td valign="top">The tonal range in this photograph is excellent, and the perspective is one of the strongest I''ve seen for this challenge.  The contrast between the girl at the foot of the steps, and hardness of the metal, is perfect as well.  Composition isn''t quite as great as the rest of the photograph, but I think it works well.</td>', 'The tonal range in this photograph is excellent, and the perspective is one of the strongest I''ve seen for this challenge.  The contrast between the girl at the foot of the steps, and hardness of the metal, is perfect as well.  Composition isn''t quite as great as the rest of the photograph, but I think it works well.', '2003-03-18 13:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(240281, 14846, 6701, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites for this challenge.  Great use of reflection, and a clever way to work it into the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites for this challenge.  Great use of reflection, and a clever way to work it into the challenge.', '2003-03-18 13:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
