(240515, 14846, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice work... the reflection is beautiful and this was a great ''catch''... excellent photo :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice work... the reflection is beautiful and this was a great ''catch''... excellent photo :) - setzler', '2003-03-18 14:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(240516, 14605, 772, '<td valign="top">great composition... the shadow is perfect along with the lower right hand positioning of the subject... nice shot :) - setzler</td>', 'great composition... the shadow is perfect along with the lower right hand positioning of the subject... nice shot :) - setzler', '2003-03-18 14:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(240518, 14038, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective of the stairs... the image seems just a tiny bit soft to me, but the composition is good :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting perspective of the stairs... the image seems just a tiny bit soft to me, but the composition is good :) - setzler', '2003-03-18 15:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(240519, 14926, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent composition... lighting must have been a challenge for this shot... natural lighting would have been preferred but I don''t know if it was possible or not... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent composition... lighting must have been a challenge for this shot... natural lighting would have been preferred but I don''t know if it was possible or not... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-03-18 15:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(240520, 14659, 1005, '<td valign="top">Challenge contradiction - subject is the baby, with the city as an incedental background.  Subject is heavily shadowed, but the focus is pretty good.  Very hazy cityscape.  5 Swash</td>', 'Challenge contradiction - subject is the baby, with the city as an incedental background.  Subject is heavily shadowed, but the focus is pretty good.  Very hazy cityscape.  5 Swash', '2003-03-18 15:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(240521, 14423, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and good focus.  Framing is fine, as is the background.  It''s a cute group of subjects, but (here''s the tough part) even though you are looking down at these pieces, I don''t get a "strong" sense of the challenge in this.  6 Swash</td>', 'Very nice color and good focus.  Framing is fine, as is the background.  It''s a cute group of subjects, but (here''s the tough part) even though you are looking down at these pieces, I don''t get a "strong" sense of the challenge in this.  6 Swash', '2003-03-18 15:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(240522, 14690, 2223, '<td valign="top">they jump from that? do they live??</td>', 'they jump from that? do they live??', '2003-03-18 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(240523, 14006, 1005, '<td valign="top">Strong effect shot.  Good focus and framing works.  Pretty intense glare on the shoes, but probably unavoidable for this set up.  Sorry, not a huge fan of extremely manip''d photos.  Too bad site rules wouldn''t allow you to "clean up" the black spots in the non-subject area of this pic.  6 Swash</td>', 'Strong effect shot.  Good focus and framing works.  Pretty intense glare on the shoes, but probably unavoidable for this set up.  Sorry, not a huge fan of extremely manip''d photos.  Too bad site rules wouldn''t allow you to "clean up" the black spots in the non-subject area of this pic.  6 Swash', '2003-03-18 15:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(240525, 14768, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty cat!  Framing seems to have chopped off it''s legs (ouch!).  Focus seems a little weak.  5 Swash</td>', 'Pretty cat!  Framing seems to have chopped off it''s legs (ouch!).  Focus seems a little weak.  5 Swash', '2003-03-18 15:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(240526, 14716, 1005, '<td valign="top">Title - true, but not always pleasant to view.  Amazingly complete skeleton.  Contrasts between background and bones is not very strong.  Focus seems sharpest on the head section.  (didn''t this carcas stink to high heaven?)<br/>5 Swash</td>', 'Title - true, but not always pleasant to view.  Amazingly complete skeleton.  Contrasts between background and bones is not very strong.  Focus seems sharpest on the head section.  (didn''t this carcas stink to high heaven?)5 Swash', '2003-03-18 15:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(240527, 14448, 1005, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Focus is pretty good.  Color seems fine.  Framing works pretty well, too.  Interest - on the low side, sorry.  6 Swash</td>', 'Challenge met.  Focus is pretty good.  Color seems fine.  Framing works pretty well, too.  Interest - on the low side, sorry.  6 Swash', '2003-03-18 15:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(240528, 14909, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice.  Framing works well, nice use of 1/3 rule.  Nice negative space.  Color - seems heavily saturated.  Focus good.  Challenge - met.  6 Swash</td>', 'This is quite nice.  Framing works well, nice use of 1/3 rule.  Nice negative space.  Color - seems heavily saturated.  Focus good.  Challenge - met.  6 Swash', '2003-03-18 15:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(240529, 14884, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo!  Nice use of shadows, good contrasts.  (well groomed feet!)  Challenge - met.  Interest - moderate.  Started this out as a 6, but it''s better than that, score upgrade to 7.  Swash</td>', 'Very sharp photo!  Nice use of shadows, good contrasts.  (well groomed feet!)  Challenge - met.  Interest - moderate.  Started this out as a 6, but it''s better than that, score upgrade to 7.  Swash', '2003-03-18 15:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(240530, 14763, 641, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this. The clarity and sharpness is great as well.</td>', 'I love the colors in this. The clarity and sharpness is great as well.', '2003-03-18 15:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(240533, 14718, 1005, '<td valign="top">Bizarre photo!  Shooting through the dandelion seeds is an interesting idea, but IMO it didn''t work very well.  No details of the flower and no details of the plants beyond.  The red areas are confusing.  (Normally, I don''t comment the border frame...sorry, but I just don''t care for this color choice.)  5 Swash</td>', 'Bizarre photo!  Shooting through the dandelion seeds is an interesting idea, but IMO it didn''t work very well.  No details of the flower and no details of the plants beyond.  The red areas are confusing.  (Normally, I don''t comment the border frame...sorry, but I just don''t care for this color choice.)  5 Swash', '2003-03-18 15:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(240544, 14312, 641, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot. Nothing more I can say ;)</td>', 'Outstanding shot. Nothing more I can say ;)', '2003-03-18 15:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(240545, 14817, 641, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The composition is really good, and is visually interesting. The contrast does seem a bit low though, could be cranked up just a little bit.</td>', 'Great shot. The composition is really good, and is visually interesting. The contrast does seem a bit low though, could be cranked up just a little bit.', '2003-03-18 15:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
