(241197, 14925, 6999, '<td valign="top">Love the effect on the truck lot itself, but for me it''s too far out of frame - the other lights being brighter, draw the eye more, and I don''t see enough there to find a real subject. There''s also another, blacker area at the bottom of frame, that looks like it could usefully have been cropped out. Good effort though.</td>', 'Love the effect on the truck lot itself, but for me it''s too far out of frame - the other lights being brighter, draw the eye more, and I don''t see enough there to find a real subject. There''s also another, blacker area at the bottom of frame, that looks like it could usefully have been cropped out. Good effort though.', '2003-03-19 06:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
