(241203, 14758, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - no criticisms at all, unless it might be fractionally too contrast-y for my taste - but that really is fractionally. Love the effect of the DOF - gives real height to the shot.</td>', 'Beautiful - no criticisms at all, unless it might be fractionally too contrast-y for my taste - but that really is fractionally. Love the effect of the DOF - gives real height to the shot.', '2003-03-19 06:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
