(241371, 14840, 5728, '<td valign="top">The lighting from dark to light is perfect! The composition is great as well as the sepia toning. The title? Well.... 9 from me.</td>', 'The lighting from dark to light is perfect! The composition is great as well as the sepia toning. The title? Well.... 9 from me.', '2003-03-19 11:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(241373, 14926, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective. The way you have cropped this photo is awesome, very good!</td>', 'Wonderful perspective. The way you have cropped this photo is awesome, very good!', '2003-03-19 11:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(241382, 14133, 5728, '<td valign="top">This isn''t really from above. It would have been a good shot from up the top there though, or even a shot from above of a bungy jumper on his way down!</td>', 'This isn''t really from above. It would have been a good shot from up the top there though, or even a shot from above of a bungy jumper on his way down!', '2003-03-19 11:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(241383, 14699, 5728, '<td valign="top">How simple! But it meets the challenge head on, and is also clear and focused. I would have cropped it a little more evenly though.</td>', 'How simple! But it meets the challenge head on, and is also clear and focused. I would have cropped it a little more evenly though.', '2003-03-19 11:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(241384, 14697, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is looking upwards! You should have climbed the tree and pointed the camera downwards to meet the challenge. What a shame, because this is a nice shot.</td>', 'This is looking upwards! You should have climbed the tree and pointed the camera downwards to meet the challenge. What a shame, because this is a nice shot.', '2003-03-19 11:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(241389, 14794, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait and very focused. The crop is great, this looks so professional. The challenge is also met, good photo!</td>', 'Lovely portrait and very focused. The crop is great, this looks so professional. The challenge is also met, good photo!', '2003-03-19 11:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(241394, 14282, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the challenge! You did this one very well, I hope you didn''t hurt yourself in the process!</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the challenge! You did this one very well, I hope you didn''t hurt yourself in the process!', '2003-03-19 12:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(241395, 14909, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome! The lighting is perfect, and your crop with all the negative space on the left gives this image a "wow" effect.</td>', 'Awesome! The lighting is perfect, and your crop with all the negative space on the left gives this image a "wow" effect.', '2003-03-19 12:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(241397, 14894, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow scarey! I feel queesy just looking at this photo. I like the angle you chose, great capture.</td>', 'Wow scarey! I feel queesy just looking at this photo. I like the angle you chose, great capture.', '2003-03-19 12:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(241398, 14343, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Full in focus, excellent composition and very funny title to boot!</td>', 'Wonderful! Full in focus, excellent composition and very funny title to boot!', '2003-03-19 12:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(241406, 14862, 4494, '<td valign="top">Is that bird crap on your cap?  What''s interesting is it looks like an old man or something.  I heard it''s good luck to have a bird crap on you. :)</td>', 'Is that bird crap on your cap?  What''s interesting is it looks like an old man or something.  I heard it''s good luck to have a bird crap on you. :)', '2003-03-19 12:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
