(241489, 14914, 4536, '<td valign="top">Hi, Jubai, I see you made it back safe. Awesome shot! Is that a bit of snow?<br/>Can''t wait to hear about your trip, heading there next month, want all the details!<br/>Which fall is this ?<br/>Hi, there, just found out that you''re not Jeremy, how embarrasing :). Would like to get some tips from you if possible. Really looking forward to this trip and standing where you were. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hi, Jubai, I see you made it back safe. Awesome shot! Is that a bit of snow?Can''t wait to hear about your trip, heading there next month, want all the details!Which fall is this ?Hi, there, just found out that you''re not Jeremy, how embarrasing :). Would like to get some tips from you if possible. Really looking forward to this trip and standing where you were. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-19 14:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
