(241853, 14265, 6328, '<td valign="top">Composition is great; Photograph meets the Challenge, that''s for sure; Visual impact is pleasing to the eye; Focus is good; Shows good idea and originality; Colour of photograph is fantastic with the sky and the ocean, the skyscrapers; you''ve done a great job.</td>', 'Composition is great; Photograph meets the Challenge, that''s for sure; Visual impact is pleasing to the eye; Focus is good; Shows good idea and originality; Colour of photograph is fantastic with the sky and the ocean, the skyscrapers; you''ve done a great job.', '2003-03-19 21:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(241854, 14796, 6328, '<td valign="top">Focus is good, good idea for the Challenge,<br/>Colours are okay, lighting seems is fine for the time of day.</td>', 'Focus is good, good idea for the Challenge,Colours are okay, lighting seems is fine for the time of day.', '2003-03-19 22:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(241855, 14910, 7418, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  Well done.</td>', 'Great concept.  Well done.', '2003-03-19 22:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(241856, 14752, 6328, '<td valign="top">What a lovely photograph.  You''ve caught some real beauty here with the waterfalls, the greenery of the trees and grass, the water, absolutely great job.</td>', 'What a lovely photograph.  You''ve caught some real beauty here with the waterfalls, the greenery of the trees and grass, the water, absolutely great job.', '2003-03-19 22:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(241857, 14689, 6110, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, really pulls the eye in.  Maybe rotate so the rungs are perfectly level?</td>', 'Great perspective, really pulls the eye in.  Maybe rotate so the rungs are perfectly level?', '2003-03-19 22:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(241858, 14883, 7418, '<td valign="top">Great colors and presentation.</td>', 'Great colors and presentation.', '2003-03-19 22:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(241859, 14690, 6328, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of the water, cliffs and the lighthouse.  Beautiful colors in the waters below, and those colors on the lighthouse are lovely.  It''s just so sad that people could come to such a lovely place as this to end their lives!</td>', 'Beautiful shot of the water, cliffs and the lighthouse.  Beautiful colors in the waters below, and those colors on the lighthouse are lovely.  It''s just so sad that people could come to such a lovely place as this to end their lives!', '2003-03-19 22:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
