(241913, 14772, 5792, '<td valign="top">B &amp; W works well here. The black tables and white chairs gives it the feel of a checkerboard. Good framing. Nicely done.</td>', 'B & W works well here. The black tables and white chairs gives it the feel of a checkerboard. Good framing. Nicely done.', '2003-03-19 23:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
