(241987, 14597, 2261, '<td valign="top">Such a shame that this is out of focus as it is a very funny and well composed shot. Your subject is fantastic in all his/her ugliness. 6 but could of been a 9 - Martin.</td>', 'Such a shame that this is out of focus as it is a very funny and well composed shot. Your subject is fantastic in all his/her ugliness. 6 but could of been a 9 - Martin.', '2003-03-20 05:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
