(242036, 14750, 3084, '<td valign="top">Superb image, just the bra strap is a slight distraction.  Nude or dressed, it would have made a wonderful image just the same, as it is all in those wonderful eyes and the beauty of her expressive face.  The hands work well to add to the image too.  The looseness of the jeans adds to the sexiness of the image and is suggestive.  The soft colours and slight over exposure makes it work.  Too bad the hair was not longer, that always seems to add more lust to this sort of image, I am not sure why?  It must be a male thing or maybe it is just me, not sure.  All in all, a fine effort by both the model and the photographer.  Congratulations. 9 Morgan</td>', 'Superb image, just the bra strap is a slight distraction.  Nude or dressed, it would have made a wonderful image just the same, as it is all in those wonderful eyes and the beauty of her expressive face.  The hands work well to add to the image too.  The looseness of the jeans adds to the sexiness of the image and is suggestive.  The soft colours and slight over exposure makes it work.  Too bad the hair was not longer, that always seems to add more lust to this sort of image, I am not sure why?  It must be a male thing or maybe it is just me, not sure.  All in all, a fine effort by both the model and the photographer.  Congratulations. 9 Morgan', '2003-03-20 08:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(242037, 14894, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great candid image. 8 Morgan</td>', 'Great candid image. 8 Morgan', '2003-03-20 08:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
