(242170, 14420, 1005, '<td valign="top">An amazing shot!  Looks like it''s right out of National Geographic!  Great focus and color.  The lighting is very nice.  It does seem like it''s a little smaller than the allowable 640x480, but nothing too important seems to have been cropped off.  Score upgrade from 9 to 10.  Swash</td>', 'An amazing shot!  Looks like it''s right out of National Geographic!  Great focus and color.  The lighting is very nice.  It does seem like it''s a little smaller than the allowable 640x480, but nothing too important seems to have been cropped off.  Score upgrade from 9 to 10.  Swash', '2003-03-20 12:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
