(242185, 14949, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken photo.  Good focus and color.  Lighting - O.K. except for that nasty glare streak on the book (diffusing the light helps or pull the book tighter/change the angle).  Interest - moderate.  6 Swash</td>', 'Well taken photo.  Good focus and color.  Lighting - O.K. except for that nasty glare streak on the book (diffusing the light helps or pull the book tighter/change the angle).  Interest - moderate.  6 Swash', '2003-03-20 13:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(242186, 14919, 1005, '<td valign="top">Drop dead gorgeous photo.  Very nice color, focus and texture.  I always like water droplets on flowers!  Challenge - indeterminate - no frame of reference to say this is looking down/up/sideways (closest clue is the water droplets and they suggest sideways to me).  6 Swash</td>', 'Drop dead gorgeous photo.  Very nice color, focus and texture.  I always like water droplets on flowers!  Challenge - indeterminate - no frame of reference to say this is looking down/up/sideways (closest clue is the water droplets and they suggest sideways to me).  6 Swash', '2003-03-20 13:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(242196, 14450, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you credit the title is right.  Color is O.K. Cropping - well the metal structure in the bottom left is not needed.  The background doesn''t add to the photo.  Sorry, but I''m going to lower your score from 6 to 5.  Swash</td>', 'I''ll give you credit the title is right.  Color is O.K. Cropping - well the metal structure in the bottom left is not needed.  The background doesn''t add to the photo.  Sorry, but I''m going to lower your score from 6 to 5.  Swash', '2003-03-20 13:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(242200, 14937, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ouch, don''t let them stab you in the eye!  (I know!)  Good color and nice framing.  Interesting shot with a fairly narrow DOF.  While I like the idea, I think the outer most tip needs to be the focal point, with the rest getting fuzzier.  Macro shots are more difficult to convey the idea of direction (as in looking down), but I do accept this shot for this challenge.  6 Swash</td>', 'Ouch, don''t let them stab you in the eye!  (I know!)  Good color and nice framing.  Interesting shot with a fairly narrow DOF.  While I like the idea, I think the outer most tip needs to be the focal point, with the rest getting fuzzier.  Macro shots are more difficult to convey the idea of direction (as in looking down), but I do accept this shot for this challenge.  6 Swash', '2003-03-20 13:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(242202, 14905, 1005, '<td valign="top">Oddly, interestingly cropped shot.  Focus seems sharp.  Challenge met.  Sorry, but it just doesn''t "grab" me.  6 Swash</td>', 'Oddly, interestingly cropped shot.  Focus seems sharp.  Challenge met.  Sorry, but it just doesn''t "grab" me.  6 Swash', '2003-03-20 13:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(242210, 14448, 3105, '<td valign="top">Just a stab in the dark, but is this at IUPUI?  It looks kind of similar to one of the adminisrative buildings that I walked through when I was in Indianapolis last year for the Star Wars Celebration.  It may not be, buildings look alike it seems.</td>', 'Just a stab in the dark, but is this at IUPUI?  It looks kind of similar to one of the adminisrative buildings that I walked through when I was in Indianapolis last year for the Star Wars Celebration.  It may not be, buildings look alike it seems.', '2003-03-20 13:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
