(242298, 14861, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty photo.  Nice color/focus/framing.  Challenge - ??  from my perspective, the camera seems level, neither looking down or up.  True the river is below you, but you''re showing almost as much sky, so I could say you were looking up just as easily.  6 Swash</td>', 'Pretty photo.  Nice color/focus/framing.  Challenge - ??  from my perspective, the camera seems level, neither looking down or up.  True the river is below you, but you''re showing almost as much sky, so I could say you were looking up just as easily.  6 Swash', '2003-03-20 16:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(242299, 14643, 1005, '<td valign="top">The cap is nicely in focus.  Color seems good.  No distracting background.  Challenge - met.  Interest - low  (now, were this beer in MY hand....)  6 Swash</td>', 'The cap is nicely in focus.  Color seems good.  No distracting background.  Challenge - met.  Interest - low  (now, were this beer in MY hand....)  6 Swash', '2003-03-20 16:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(242301, 14711, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good, clear photo, but a bit hazy.  Challenge - from my perspective, it seems more like the camera is level or possibly slightly up.  6 Swash</td>', 'Good, clear photo, but a bit hazy.  Challenge - from my perspective, it seems more like the camera is level or possibly slightly up.  6 Swash', '2003-03-20 16:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(242303, 14848, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done portrait.  Challenge met.  Contrast and lighting are good.  I started this photo as a 6, mostly my bad/bias/lack of interest in photos of children, but then I concluded I was being biased.  Score upgrade to 8.  Swash</td>', 'Very nicely done portrait.  Challenge met.  Contrast and lighting are good.  I started this photo as a 6, mostly my bad/bias/lack of interest in photos of children, but then I concluded I was being biased.  Score upgrade to 8.  Swash', '2003-03-20 16:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
