(242551, 14685, 6172, '<td valign="top">Hey this is cool!  Did you arrange that guy to be riding by on a bike with red on it, and he even has a red shirt tail hanging out?  That''s too freakey to be coincidence.  Come on, tell the truth now!</td>', 'Hey this is cool!  Did you arrange that guy to be riding by on a bike with red on it, and he even has a red shirt tail hanging out?  That''s too freakey to be coincidence.  Come on, tell the truth now!', '2003-03-21 02:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
