(242589, 14298, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this shot. Fun stuff to see the fish''s mouth there. There are a lot of things that compete with the fish, however, such as the lines and colors on the boat, and even the rocks themselves.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this shot. Fun stuff to see the fish''s mouth there. There are a lot of things that compete with the fish, however, such as the lines and colors on the boat, and even the rocks themselves.', '2003-03-21 08:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(242590, 14843, 6870, '<td valign="top">You''ve made this into an abstract with this "macro" shot, which is clever. I don''t find it all that interesting, but there is some interesting light going on. You might try fiddling around more with your light/dark levels to create more dynamic shadows and invite more interest.</td>', 'You''ve made this into an abstract with this "macro" shot, which is clever. I don''t find it all that interesting, but there is some interesting light going on. You might try fiddling around more with your light/dark levels to create more dynamic shadows and invite more interest.', '2003-03-21 09:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(242592, 14832, 6870, '<td valign="top">This image certainly fits the challenge this week. I also like the varioud lines that lead the eye to different parts of the image. With more engaging light, the photo would be far more interesting, I feel.</td>', 'This image certainly fits the challenge this week. I also like the varioud lines that lead the eye to different parts of the image. With more engaging light, the photo would be far more interesting, I feel.', '2003-03-21 09:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
