(242595, 14898, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts here, and the placement of the beer bottle in the image. I just wish it were in focus. Try the macro feature on the camera if you have it. That may allow you to get close and still keep focus.</td>', 'I like the contrasts here, and the placement of the beer bottle in the image. I just wish it were in focus. Try the macro feature on the camera if you have it. That may allow you to get close and still keep focus.', '2003-03-21 09:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(242596, 14635, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, with lots of great lines, shadows and tones. I''m sure you''ve been reminded that it doesn''t fit the challenge, but at least know that it''s a pretty good photo. It could be more in focus, however. It would be nice to get all of those branches in sharp detail.</td>', 'Interesting shot, with lots of great lines, shadows and tones. I''m sure you''ve been reminded that it doesn''t fit the challenge, but at least know that it''s a pretty good photo. It could be more in focus, however. It would be nice to get all of those branches in sharp detail.', '2003-03-21 09:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
