(242679, 14728, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is pretty. I think I prefer it as a portrait image losing a lot from the left and even more from the right, bring the line down the middle of the image. Just my two pence though. Kavey</td>', 'This is pretty. I think I prefer it as a portrait image losing a lot from the left and even more from the right, bring the line down the middle of the image. Just my two pence though. Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(242684, 14793, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this - great leading lines and wonderful lighting. Makes me actually feel the boredom of the daily commute.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'I really like this - great leading lines and wonderful lighting. Makes me actually feel the boredom of the daily commute.9, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(242687, 14763, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really love the colours and arrangement here as well as the top-down viewpoint. I find the objects too close to the lower edge of the frame.<br/>I''d either centre them in the space you''ve used now or, if you want to go for that off centre/ negative space look then I''d prefer the objects a little smaller within the frame, towards the lower left, but still with a wee bit more space below them.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'I really love the colours and arrangement here as well as the top-down viewpoint. I find the objects too close to the lower edge of the frame.I''d either centre them in the space you''ve used now or, if you want to go for that off centre/ negative space look then I''d prefer the objects a little smaller within the frame, towards the lower left, but still with a wee bit more space below them.8, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(242688, 14775, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful geometric composition from such an organic subject!<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'Beautiful geometric composition from such an organic subject!9, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(242691, 14764, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely great use of DOF and a really dynamic composition. Just a teeny weeny bit too dark for me but then that does add to the mood.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'Absolutely great use of DOF and a really dynamic composition. Just a teeny weeny bit too dark for me but then that does add to the mood.9, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(242692, 14686, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pattern and light and shade. I really like this very much.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'Wonderful pattern and light and shade. I really like this very much.9, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(242694, 14243, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fantastic viewpoint and a very exciting image. I can easily imagine it on the front cover of a family holiday travel brochure.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Fantastic viewpoint and a very exciting image. I can easily imagine it on the front cover of a family holiday travel brochure.8, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(242695, 14904, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is strangely appealing...<br/>Fantastic movement you''ve captured and a lovely sepia tone.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'This is strangely appealing...Fantastic movement you''ve captured and a lovely sepia tone.8, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(242696, 14848, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!<br/>I''d like a little more space at the left, to match that at the top.<br/>I find the lighting on his face just a touch harsh.<br/>But it is a wonderful capture and his expression is just adorable.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Beautiful!I''d like a little more space at the left, to match that at the top.I find the lighting on his face just a touch harsh.But it is a wonderful capture and his expression is just adorable.8, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(242697, 14751, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great abstract and nice use of DOF to blur that background. <br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Great abstract and nice use of DOF to blur that background. 8, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(242698, 14884, 3087, '<td valign="top">This photo is so good that it deserves the 8 despite my weird aversion to feet!<br/>Interesting light and shadow angles = exciting composition.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'This photo is so good that it deserves the 8 despite my weird aversion to feet!Interesting light and shadow angles = exciting composition.8, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(242700, 14937, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really love the DOF here - infact great use of DOF features in a lot of my 10s, 9s and 8s this week.<br/>Wonderful composition and colours too.<br/>Only marred by that one bright spot at back left. Could it have been avoided with a reflector or someone blocking that shaft of light with their hand?<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'I really love the DOF here - infact great use of DOF features in a lot of my 10s, 9s and 8s this week.Wonderful composition and colours too.Only marred by that one bright spot at back left. Could it have been avoided with a reflector or someone blocking that shaft of light with their hand?8, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(242701, 14434, 3087, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of an old-style French postcard.<br/>A beautiful picture.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Reminds me of an old-style French postcard.A beautiful picture.8, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(242702, 14750, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good picture.<br/>Compositionally I''d like her more centred, horizontally.<br/>Lighting is too harsh for my preferences.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Good picture.Compositionally I''d like her more centred, horizontally.Lighting is too harsh for my preferences.8, Kavey', '2003-03-21 12:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
