(242821, 14812, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the towers from down HERE including the night clouds, but you were supposed to shoot something from UP there looking DOWN here.  I don''t think you''re going get accepted into the Challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot of the towers from down HERE including the night clouds, but you were supposed to shoot something from UP there looking DOWN here.  I don''t think you''re going get accepted into the Challenge.', '2003-03-21 15:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(242826, 14872, 6328, '<td valign="top">Interesting photograph of the Pigeon. Shows lovely colors of the bird and his feathers.  Good focus, composition is excellent, visual interest is splendid.<br/>I think you cropped just a bit too much off his tail though.</td>', 'Interesting photograph of the Pigeon. Shows lovely colors of the bird and his feathers.  Good focus, composition is excellent, visual interest is splendid.I think you cropped just a bit too much off his tail though.', '2003-03-21 15:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
