(242956, 14782, 6325, '<td valign="top">Never thought I would say it, but that''s a cute snake. The colors and lighting  in the snake are fantastic. Focus on the snake is good. The background totally distracts from the snake. Maybe try some different colored papers - white, purple, black. Please post some more shots in different backgrounds - this is a great subject.</td>', 'Never thought I would say it, but that''s a cute snake. The colors and lighting  in the snake are fantastic. Focus on the snake is good. The background totally distracts from the snake. Maybe try some different colored papers - white, purple, black. Please post some more shots in different backgrounds - this is a great subject.', '2003-03-21 22:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
