(243246, 14750, 3320, '<td valign="top">Classic and very nicely done. I think I would have picked an other color for the bra as it''s the only pink in the shot and more a ''side effect''. Good shot otherwise. I like the face expression. Maybe the contrast is too strong (shadow too strong botteom left corner). 7 . Lionel</td>', 'Classic and very nicely done. I think I would have picked an other color for the bra as it''s the only pink in the shot and more a ''side effect''. Good shot otherwise. I like the face expression. Maybe the contrast is too strong (shadow too strong botteom left corner). 7 . Lionel', '2003-03-22 21:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(243248, 14685, 3320, '<td valign="top">I do on tknow why but I like the simplicity of this shot. Simple and qiuet. I like it The only thing I do not like but I guess you could not do different is the green vertical sign cut. Usually if there is a word somewhere it''s better to have it fully in the picture. Less important in that case as the sign is vertical. Nice photo. 7. Lionel</td>', 'I do on tknow why but I like the simplicity of this shot. Simple and qiuet. I like it The only thing I do not like but I guess you could not do different is the green vertical sign cut. Usually if there is a word somewhere it''s better to have it fully in the picture. Less important in that case as the sign is vertical. Nice photo. 7. Lionel', '2003-03-22 21:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(243249, 14015, 3320, '<td valign="top">I like the shot ... but do not meet the challenege to me. 7 an other week. 5 this week. Lionel</td>', 'I like the shot ... but do not meet the challenege to me. 7 an other week. 5 this week. Lionel', '2003-03-22 21:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
