(243574, 14747, 3087, '<td valign="top">My favourite image this week. I think this is superb!<br/>DOF on the chain is interesting. Composition is good.<br/>Background is interesting without being distracting.<br/>Her expression is happy with a touch of mischief.<br/>Great!<br/>Fingers crossed for a win for this image!<br/>10, Kavey</td>', 'My favourite image this week. I think this is superb!DOF on the chain is interesting. Composition is good.Background is interesting without being distracting.Her expression is happy with a touch of mischief.Great!Fingers crossed for a win for this image!10, Kavey', '2003-03-23 17:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(243575, 14038, 6597, '<td valign="top">good color</td>', 'good color', '2003-03-23 17:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(243576, 14384, 3087, '<td valign="top">My 2nd 10 this week. Superb!<br/>I love the texture and colour of the frothy beer in the glass against the clear sharp contours of the glass and that wonderful light shadow.<br/>10, Kavey<br/> <br/> <br/>(Edit to correct typo only)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-03-24 07:19:25.</i></td>', 'My 2nd 10 this week. Superb!I love the texture and colour of the frothy beer in the glass against the clear sharp contours of the glass and that wonderful light shadow.10, Kavey  (Edit to correct typo only)', '2003-03-23 17:01:09.000000', '2003-03-24 07:19:25.000000', 1),
(243577, 14948, 6597, '<td valign="top">good texture</td>', 'good texture', '2003-03-23 17:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(243578, 14907, 6870, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF and great composition/placement of the caterpillar. Sharp focus too. The "verticalness" of the shot may be enhanced if you turned the image 90 degrees CW or perhaps even 180 degrees. Really well done. 9</td>', 'Excellent DOF and great composition/placement of the caterpillar. Sharp focus too. The "verticalness" of the shot may be enhanced if you turned the image 90 degrees CW or perhaps even 180 degrees. Really well done. 9', '2003-03-23 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(243579, 14872, 6870, '<td valign="top">Sharp bird and wonderful tones make this a great photo. I like the bird up close, but I would like more room by his head: Rule of thirds may apply here slightly. Still, very nice.</td>', 'Sharp bird and wonderful tones make this a great photo. I like the bird up close, but I would like more room by his head: Rule of thirds may apply here slightly. Still, very nice.', '2003-03-23 17:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(243580, 14006, 6870, '<td valign="top">The high contrast works well for me here. Simply an excellent shot.</td>', 'The high contrast works well for me here. Simply an excellent shot.', '2003-03-23 17:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(243581, 14844, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super boots shot. Would work well as a Stock image! Nice balance of light and dark, contrast and sharpness. 9</td>', 'Super boots shot. Would work well as a Stock image! Nice balance of light and dark, contrast and sharpness. 9', '2003-03-23 17:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(243584, 14685, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice. You''ve captured a nice piece of quiet city life in this well composed image. Everything works for me. 10 (one of 3 for me this week)</td>', 'Very nice. You''ve captured a nice piece of quiet city life in this well composed image. Everything works for me. 10 (one of 3 for me this week)', '2003-03-23 17:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(243585, 14904, 6870, '<td valign="top">Slightly overexposed for my tastes, but super mud, and sharp as can be. Wonderul image.</td>', 'Slightly overexposed for my tastes, but super mud, and sharp as can be. Wonderul image.', '2003-03-23 17:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(243586, 14950, 6870, '<td valign="top">The odd perspective and composition really works here with the flowers coming DOWN from the top rather than from the bottom. Nice colors, too.</td>', 'The odd perspective and composition really works here with the flowers coming DOWN from the top rather than from the bottom. Nice colors, too.', '2003-03-23 17:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(243587, 14498, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple, but your diagonal lines and interesting tones and textures keep my interest. Nice work.</td>', 'Simple, but your diagonal lines and interesting tones and textures keep my interest. Nice work.', '2003-03-23 17:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(243589, 14849, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very engaging image. I''d like to see even more of the girl. Nice job.</td>', 'Very engaging image. I''d like to see even more of the girl. Nice job.', '2003-03-23 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(243590, 14212, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your image works for me because you''ve managed through light and shadow and composition to make this little puppet seem like it is alive. Nicely done.</td>', 'Your image works for me because you''ve managed through light and shadow and composition to make this little puppet seem like it is alive. Nicely done.', '2003-03-23 17:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(243591, 14931, 4969, '<td valign="top">excellent!!</td>', 'excellent!!', '2003-03-23 17:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(243593, 14690, 4969, '<td valign="top">where is beachy head? and why such a high suicide rate?</td>', 'where is beachy head? and why such a high suicide rate?', '2003-03-23 17:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(243594, 14286, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely, soft, and the lighting is terrific. Even though you''ve got the veins sharp, It still looks just slightly out of focus for some reason. Still, high marks from me.</td>', 'Lovely, soft, and the lighting is terrific. Even though you''ve got the veins sharp, It still looks just slightly out of focus for some reason. Still, high marks from me.', '2003-03-23 17:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(243595, 14948, 4969, '<td valign="top">i had to look twice for the pigeon at first i thought it was a boot? good effort</td>', 'i had to look twice for the pigeon at first i thought it was a boot? good effort', '2003-03-23 17:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(243596, 14864, 4969, '<td valign="top">the tower in paris?<br/></td>', 'the tower in paris?', '2003-03-23 17:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(243598, 14838, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cute cat (rather like mine), and the focus is superb. I give this high marks, but I''d still like to see more interesting light to make this image really pack a whollup.</td>', 'Cute cat (rather like mine), and the focus is superb. I give this high marks, but I''d still like to see more interesting light to make this image really pack a whollup.', '2003-03-23 17:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(243599, 14752, 4969, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2003-03-23 17:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(243600, 14904, 4969, '<td valign="top">looks like jacko''s cream shot lol</td>', 'looks like jacko''s cream shot lol', '2003-03-23 17:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(243601, 14888, 6870, '<td valign="top">The delightful interplay of light here would be even more interesting on a background other that white, I feel. Still, nice work.</td>', 'The delightful interplay of light here would be even more interesting on a background other that white, I feel. Still, nice work.', '2003-03-23 17:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(243602, 14747, 527, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. My top pick. The composition, colors,  and perspective are perfect. The great texture and details throughout realy help tie it all together.<br/> <br/>T</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. My top pick. The composition, colors,  and perspective are perfect. The great texture and details throughout realy help tie it all together. T', '2003-03-23 17:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(243603, 14343, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well composed, interesting light, and I love the shoes. Lines and angles add to the interest here.</td>', 'Well composed, interesting light, and I love the shoes. Lines and angles add to the interest here.', '2003-03-23 17:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(243604, 14919, 6870, '<td valign="top">Another rose. I''m glad: I like roses! Yours is lovely. Try turning the image by 90 or 180 degrees to enhance the "from above" feel. It almost looks like you''re looking up into this beauty. A larger DOF would get more of the rose in focus. I like this peaceful shot.</td>', 'Another rose. I''m glad: I like roses! Yours is lovely. Try turning the image by 90 or 180 degrees to enhance the "from above" feel. It almost looks like you''re looking up into this beauty. A larger DOF would get more of the rose in focus. I like this peaceful shot.', '2003-03-23 17:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(243605, 14721, 527, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images that could have really benefitted from a wide angle lens. As it is it is still very good with strong composition and great detail. Angling the image was a good idea.<br/> <br/>T</td>', 'This is one of those images that could have really benefitted from a wide angle lens. As it is it is still very good with strong composition and great detail. Angling the image was a good idea. T', '2003-03-23 17:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(243606, 14793, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and light. Great use of line, too.</td>', 'Wonderful tones and light. Great use of line, too.', '2003-03-23 17:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(243607, 14006, 527, '<td valign="top">One of my tens for the week. It''s simple, it''s dramatic, it''s detailed, and it''s just plain fun to look at. Very good job!</td>', 'One of my tens for the week. It''s simple, it''s dramatic, it''s detailed, and it''s just plain fun to look at. Very good job!', '2003-03-23 17:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(243612, 14015, 527, '<td valign="top">Oops. A misinterpretation of the rules. This is still a very interesting photo with nice composition,  texture, and detail. I always prefer when the subject is not looking at the camera. It tends to emphasize the fact that there is a camera and another person involved. I much prefer the subject looking away at something. This creatres curiousity and wonder about what the subject is looking at or thinking about. Good job.<br/> <br/>T</td>', 'Oops. A misinterpretation of the rules. This is still a very interesting photo with nice composition,  texture, and detail. I always prefer when the subject is not looking at the camera. It tends to emphasize the fact that there is a camera and another person involved. I much prefer the subject looking away at something. This creatres curiousity and wonder about what the subject is looking at or thinking about. Good job. T', '2003-03-23 17:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(243620, 14585, 2978, '<td valign="top">Interesting POV</td>', 'Interesting POV', '2003-03-23 17:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(243622, 14752, 1439, '<td valign="top">beautiful landscape, is it taken from plane</td>', 'beautiful landscape, is it taken from plane', '2003-03-23 17:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(243626, 14343, 2605, '<td valign="top">great title!</td>', 'great title!', '2003-03-23 17:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(243627, 14757, 2605, '<td valign="top">great title</td>', 'great title', '2003-03-23 17:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
