(243796, 14298, 509, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge, but overall the scene is a little too abstract for me.  I think the shallow focus landscape works here, but the boat blocks too much of the fish, and overall clashes with the scene.</td>', 'This meets the challenge, but overall the scene is a little too abstract for me.  I think the shallow focus landscape works here, but the boat blocks too much of the fish, and overall clashes with the scene.', '2003-03-23 21:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(243797, 14861, 509, '<td valign="top">While I think this is a very nice scene, I think the relation to the challenge is stretched here.  Technically it is taken above the water, but it is primarily a landscape.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'While I think this is a very nice scene, I think the relation to the challenge is stretched here.  Technically it is taken above the water, but it is primarily a landscape.  Nice shot though.', '2003-03-23 21:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
