(243818, 14635, 509, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, but to me, the challenge "from above" reflects more or less an opposite to the "from the ground up" challenge, and while this would definitely work for the latter, the impact of "from above" isn''t very powerful here.  This is just my interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this image, but to me, the challenge "from above" reflects more or less an opposite to the "from the ground up" challenge, and while this would definitely work for the latter, the impact of "from above" isn''t very powerful here.  This is just my interpretation of the challenge.', '2003-03-23 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
