(244068, 14699, 1344, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by drydoc:</b></div><hr/><i>Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...I like this shot.  Very clean and simple. Meets the challenge perfectly.  But for some reason my minds eye keeps wanting to put a kid in the box!</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Do we need to send the cops to your house drydoc?</td>', 'Originally posted by drydoc:Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...I like this shot.  Very clean and simple. Meets the challenge perfectly.  But for some reason my minds eye keeps wanting to put a kid in the box!  Do we need to send the cops to your house drydoc?', '2003-03-24 01:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
