(711672, 14812, 21430, '<td valign="top">Being an owner of that particularly limited digital camera, I have to say I am quite impressed with the photo that you were able to get out of it.<br/> <br/>  Personally, the best shots I have been able to get out of that camera is at the North American International Autoshow this past year at Cobo Hall in Detroit, Michigan. Of course, you have to practically fall over yourself to get crappy pictures at the Autoshow...<br/> <br/>  Again, I am impressed with the shot.</td>', 'Being an owner of that particularly limited digital camera, I have to say I am quite impressed with the photo that you were able to get out of it.   Personally, the best shots I have been able to get out of that camera is at the North American International Autoshow this past year at Cobo Hall in Detroit, Michigan. Of course, you have to practically fall over yourself to get crappy pictures at the Autoshow...   Again, I am impressed with the shot.', '2004-05-11 15:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(732765, 14840, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous photo. Good for you for sticking to your guns. Every suggestion someone offers is not necessarily a valid one or helpful to the photographer and you certainly have the right to ignore advice. <br/>I love the dramatic lighting; it emphasizes her beautiful figure. It''s called chiaroscuro folks and artists have been using it for centuries. <br/> <br/>chiaroscuro - A word borrowed from Italian ("light and shade" or "dark") referring to the modeling of volume by depicting light and shade by contrasting them boldly.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is a gorgeous photo. Good for you for sticking to your guns. Every suggestion someone offers is not necessarily a valid one or helpful to the photographer and you certainly have the right to ignore advice. I love the dramatic lighting; it emphasizes her beautiful figure. It''s called chiaroscuro folks and artists have been using it for centuries.  chiaroscuro - A word borrowed from Italian ("light and shade" or "dark") referring to the modeling of volume by depicting light and shade by contrasting them boldly. ', '2004-05-24 00:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
