(1481782, 14933, 16488, '<td valign="top">Long before my time at DPC!<br/> <br/>The obvious impressers were the color and point of view....and I agree. A tighter crop from the left might have saved this...but what do I know, and you didn''t ask.<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing in the "closest to 5" game, today.  It''s good for some of us to see humility shared.   (and this ain''t so humble)</td>', 'Long before my time at DPC! The obvious impressers were the color and point of view....and I agree. A tighter crop from the left might have saved this...but what do I know, and you didn''t ask. Thanks for sharing in the "closest to 5" game, today.  It''s good for some of us to see humility shared.   (and this ain''t so humble)', '2005-06-24 18:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
